OL,3,GNEWSAPublic confidence 'damaged' by
OL,4,Aon-the-run killer case, says Long
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublic confidence in the justice system
OL,7,Fhas been "damaged" by the circumstances
OL,8,Fsurrounding the release from prison of
OL,9,Fconvicted murderer Gary Anderson,
OL,10,FJustice Minister Naomi Long has said.
OL,12,FAnderson, who is one of two brothers
OL,13,Fjailed for life in 2023 for the 2018
OL,14,Fmurder of Karol Kelly in Londonderry,
OL,15,Fremains at large a week after he
OL,16,Fabsconded while attending his father's
OL,17,Ffuneral in Derry last Monday.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
